OL,3,GNEWSAWater supply back to normal days
OL,4,Aafter pipe burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe water supply is back to normal and
OL,7,Fa repair for a burst main has been
OL,8,Fcompleted, after a street was under
OL,9,Fwater in Wolverhampton.
OL,11,FOn Friday, Severn Trent Water said
OL,12,Fpeople experienced no supply, poor
OL,13,Fpressure or discoloured water, because
OL,14,Fof a burst pipe on Church Street in
OL,15,FBilston.
OL,17,FIt later added, at about 09:35 BST on
OL,18,FSunday, that the repair for the main in
OL,19,Fthe WV14 and WV13 areas had been
OL,20,Ffinished.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
